<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Witter cuts Donnelley.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Witter cuts Donnelley.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter lowered its recommendation on R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co to neutral from buy, a Dean Witter source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- R.R. Donnelley's stock fell 3/8 to 32-3/4 in early trade on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
